21AUG2024 @hanoihantrakul
The BigMusic recipe is based on YAML's
`recipes/umm/conf/umm_stage1_2255mixedZHEN.yaml`
`recipes/umm/conf/umm_stage2_2255mixedZHEN.yaml`
`recipes/umm/conf/umm_stage3_2255mixedZHEN_2375Speech.yaml`

I use the same configuration but now train on data [2255, 2375, 794]
instead of just [2255,2375]

I still keep the same loss heads, namely [mel_loss, chroma_loss, ctc_loss].

The purpose of this config was to train the already succesfull ConformerUMM_2255_2375
on unified data. 


